Package: cohortshift
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Aggregate Study-versus-Target Subgroup Evidence
Description: Compare fictional aggregate age and severity counts for a study
    and a target population. Report marginal gaps and label each intersection
    as an exact count, a Fréchet bound, or unavailable.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Author: CohortShift contributors
Maintainer: CohortShift contributors <cohortshift@users.noreply.github.com>
